{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/810b8f9b4ae731e553854c28793b40aea360a5a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 + 4 + 6) - (1 + 3 + 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"196\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/0/050e5176742be23ce67dd15775399e88e0f7767b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ -3 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 21 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 111$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/4/e94710385456ad1a7cbf2a943e1bd33b5477b97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 + 4 + 6) - (1 + 3 + 5) = (6 + 6) - (4 + 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc806c54986861e6c3d3707c6940c2ed05aa299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=12 - 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/3/7434492e5674ddab6c80f7f66f01f80fbf44a619.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/0/5e0e11dd37aa4cc8471bea6c994a1e32ccc486e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 + 4 + 6) - (1 + 3 + 5) = 2 - 1 + 4 - 3 + 6 - 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"386\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/1/ed1142dbaeef4228c7e447f0de7699e61eafc54c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1 + 1 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/3/7434492e5674ddab6c80f7f66f01f80fbf44a619.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td w